            "review_title": "Review at Surf Bar 2",
            "review_text": "Mr NHD\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1473 contributions\n1\nExcellent\nJan 2024 • Friends\nThe first thing is that this bar is located right on the beach, in the center of Quy Nhon City, very easy to find and come here to relax and chill.\nThe restaurant is very impressive with its intimate architecture, cool outdoor space, and magical interior.\nThe tables are spaced apart so it is very comfortable and private to chat without interference.\nDrinks are reasonably priced, this place is suitable for groups of friends to gather and relax after a day of sightseeing in Quy Nhon.\nStaff are also friendly & cheerful.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten January 16, 2024",
