            "review_text": "letrongkhanh\nDanang8 contributions\n0\nEnjoying the night by the sea\nJan 2018 • Business\nQuy Nhon is a peaceful city in the south central coast of Vietnam, of which tourism in recent years has developed fast. I came here for Business trip early Jan 2018 and was surprised by the beauty of this city.\n\nDuring night you could choose to enjoy some coconut juice, smoothies or sugar cane juice. But if you just want something different, go to Surf Bar on the beach (there are two Surf Bars). The set-up is nice with lights and bulbs, soft music. Sipping beer or margarita is wonderful.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 3, 2018",
